This product includes software derived from MediaPipe
(https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe), Copyright 2019 The MediaPipe
Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The BlazeEar architecture, its anchor layout, and the two-stage
detect-then-crop pipeline follow MediaPipe's BlazeFace design, and
model_weights/blazeface.pth holds MediaPipe's published BlazeFace weights,
which the two-stage pipeline runs unmodified as its first stage.

