why they are the one part of this repository that is not Apache-2.0.

Source matches were established by perceptual hash against the training
corpus, so treat the attributions as the dataset of origin rather than as a
per-photograph licence determination. Anyone redistributing these images, or
reusing them outside this repository, should check the terms of the specific
source image.

The training data itself is not distributed here at all: /data is excluded
from version control, so no dataset images or annotations are redistributed.

